{
  "case_id": "MEGAS-ACTIVE-1.21.1",
  "title": "机械师立牌(megas)主动「轨道轰炸」核心取证：① 激活门控 —— 手牌 1 张(<2) 时产品拒绝(performOrbitalBombardment 返回 false)，不消耗、不冷却、靶血量不变；② 基础口径 —— 4 张效果牌 => 次数 strikes=floor(4/2)=2、单轮伤害=基础 2(效果牌无费用) => 总伤害 4 => 靶 500->496，且 confirm 真实路径当拍把手牌清空、写入玩家级冷却(cd_rem 约 2400t)。伤害以**靶血量差**为独立观测，不引用产品的中间量。",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "new",
    "ref": "megas_sign"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：机械师立牌(megas)「轨道轰炸 / 物资补充 / 精准打击」游戏内取证。\n本用例组由探针 megas* 系列驱动，**只调产品公开函数**（MegasSignItem / OrbitalBombardmentManager / PrecisionStrikeEffect / ModAttachments），断言锚定 latest.log 的 AP_<tag>_MEGAS 机器行。\n\n**期望值均按产品常量独立推算**（不读产品的中间量）：RADIUS=12、BASE_DAMAGE=2、MAX_STRIKES=10、\nPRECISION_THRESHOLD=6、COST_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER=2、STRIKE_INTERVAL=20t、FALL=12t、合计单轮约 32t；\n主动冷却 120s=2400t；被动间隔 1200t、阈值 6 张。\n  次数 strikes = min(floor(消耗卡牌数 / 2), 10)；\n  单轮伤害 = BASE(2) + 战斗牌费用总和 x2；若有「精准打击」则该轮再 + 当前层数；\n  总伤害 = strikes x per + (precision ? strikes x (strikes+1)/2 : 0)。\n\n**场景控制**：doMobSpawning false（仅本用例内，末尾恢复）避免自然刷怪混入目标池；\n探针读数里的 near（指定靶 12 格内存活实体数）恒应为 1 —— 若被污染则**响亮失败**，\n不把伤害平摊当成功。\n\nWARN 冷却写在 TargetSelectionAction#apply 内 => 只有 megascast confirm 档能验冷却；\nWARN 轰炸异步（每轮 20t 间隔 + 12t 下落）=> 伤害/层数必须在用例侧 wait 之后读。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..128]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "相位 A（激活门控）：手牌 1 张(<2) => megascast direct 必须返回 ret=0（产品拒绝），且手牌**不消耗**、冷却**不写入**、靶血量**不变**（wait 后复核）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/give @s astral_dice:effect_card_hamburger 1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasprep A0 500 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascd A0b fresh",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread A1 PRE",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascast A2 direct",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread A2 MIN_REJECT",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread A3 MIN_AFTER",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "相位 B（基础口径）：4 张效果牌(无费用) => strikes=min(4/2,10)=2、per=2、无精准打击\n=> 期望总伤害 2x2=4 => 靶 500 -> 496。冷却写在 apply 内 => confirm 档应读到 cd_rem 约 2400。"
    },
    {
